          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "WGSL source for the WebGPU backend - one module carrying both entry points, the same convention ShaderSource uses for materials. The fragment entry point must be fragmentMain. A module that declares no @vertex stage gets the default fullscreen-quad vertex stage (vertexMain, plus its VsOut struct) prepended; a module that declares one must name it vertexMain and emit @location(0) vUv: vec2<f32>."
